              "text": "The term **\"Chase Capital Services\"** typically refers to one of two main entities, depending on whether you are looking for information regarding **U.S. automotive leasing** or a **financial services company in India**. \n\n---\n\n### 1. U.S. Auto Leasing (JPMorgan Chase Bank, N.A.)\nIf you are looking at a vehicle title, registration, or lease agreement in the United States and see \"Chase Capital Services,\" this refers to the automotive leasing division of **JPMorgan Chase**.\n\n* **What it is:** Chase Auto Finance operates several \"private-label\" or captive finance partnerships for major car manufacturers. Under these agreements, Chase acts as the lessor and holds the title to the vehicle under the name **Chase Capital Services**. \n* **Common Brands Associated with Chase Auto:** \n  * **Subaru** (Subaru Motors Finance)\n  * **Mazda** (Mazda Capital Services\u2014note that while Mazda moved its primary new captive financing to Toyota Financial Services in 2020, older leases and pre-existing titles still list Chase).\n  * **Jaguar and Land Rover** (historically serviced by Chase).\n* **Lease Buyouts & Transfers:** If you are planning a lease buyout, transferring your registration to a new state, or selling your car to a third party (like Carvana or Carmax), you will need to contact **Chase Auto Customer Service** directly. They will provide the official payoff quote, power of attorney, or the signed-off title required by your local DMV.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Chase Capital Services Private Limited (India)\nIf you are researching a business by this name in Asia, **Chase Capital Services Pvt. Ltd.** is an independent financial consulting firm based in India.\n\n* **Overview:** Established in May 1997, it is an active, unlisted private non-government company. \n* **Location:** Headquartered in Chandigarh / Mohali (Punjab), India.\n* **Services Offered:** \n  * Project Consultancy\n  * Debt Syndication and Securitisation\n  * Corporate Advisory\n  * Currency and Commodities Trading (associated with recognized Indian exchanges)\n  * Cross-border transaction services\n\n---\n\n### 3. Chase Capital (Canada)\nThere is also a private capital platform named **Chase Capital** based in Canada. This entity focuses on growth capital, private equity investing, and advisory services for mid-market Canadian businesses looking to scale.\n\n***\n\n*If you are trying to contact one of these entities, please specify whether you need assistance with a **Chase Auto Lease (U.S.)**, **corporate financial consulting (India)**, or **private equity (Canada)** so that more specific contact details can be provided.*",
